## 2. Code Changes

### [shared/db.py](file:///c:/Users/ariji/Desktop/github/Bulwark/shared/db.py)
- Added a `with_mongo_retry` decorator to handle transient database write errors (retries up to 3 times on `AutoReconnect` or `ServerSelectionTimeoutError` using exponential back-off).
- Decorated all database write functions: `create_simulation`, `update_simulation`, `cancel_in_progress_simulation`, `log_override_event`, `save_verdict`, `save_environment_config`.
- Added a new decorated `enqueue_message` function for developer mode queueing.

### [webhook_receiver/main.py](file:///c:/Users/ariji/Desktop/github/Bulwark/webhook_receiver/main.py)
- Replaced direct `insert_one` database calls to the `simulations` and `message_queue` collections with the decorated `create_simulation` and `enqueue_message` helper functions.

### [tests/test_webhook.py](file:///c:/Users/ariji/Desktop/github/Bulwark/tests/test_webhook.py)
- Updated mock hooks to patch `shared.db.get_database` in addition to `webhook_receiver.main.get_database` so that imported database wrapper functions return the mock DB instance rather than initiating real connections.

